s up to 8 markets, from launches and our seasonal sales to our biggest moments.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong>Your tasks</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run the campaigns from start to finish. Bring the right people in the room together from the product kickoff onwards, so we get the best concepts.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Write the campaign briefs, with objectives, targets and all the details needed to approve before kick-off.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Chase for the deliverables. Manage our marketing channel stakeholders (Creative, storytelling, assets, product copy, influencer briefs, landing pages, CRM flows, retail materials, market adaptation) and keep everyone on the same brief and dates.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Adapt per market, working with the country leads on what changes locally, ensuring we are agile and localize the campaigns accordingly.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are responsible for ensuring that we are ready before go-live. Detail oriented and escalating proactively if anything is missing.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Keep the process light and current. Maintain the Notion campaign templates, the RACI and campaign pages so everyone has the information needed to succeed.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Put together all learnings and results post-campaigns together. Ensure we have inputs from all teams and stakeholders. The post-mortem is based on evidence,</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring in market trends, competitor promotions and cultural moments to sharpen every campaign</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Plan for every channel according to the calendar: Sephora, Amazon and TikTok Shop alongside our own sites, with assets, timing and price parity aligned.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Your profile</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">3–5 years in advertising (account or strategy side), or in growth or campaign marketing at a D2C brand. You know how to hold others accountable and are detail oriented.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have delivered multi-channel, multi-market campaigns on time and can show the plans behind them</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You can write and judge headlines, hooks and CTAs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You work well with Brand and Creative teams, hold the commercial line without friction, and align people you don’t manage</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You think in revenue, sell-through, AOV and margin, and can argue why one offer beats another</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You take ownership, bring solutions and keep process light</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent English; a second EU language is a plus</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Beauty or D2C experience is a plus</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h3><strong>What We Offer</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Dynamic Environment:</strong> The opportunity to work in a start-up environment surrounded by a passionate and dedicated team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Accelerate Your Career:</strong> Take on responsibility from day 1, with room for professional growth and advancement as the company continues to expand.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Inspiring Workspace</strong>: Located in the heart of Berlin's Prenzlauer Berg, a dog-friendly office, with free drinks and snacks.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Hybrid Working: </strong>We understand that sometimes you get more stuff done from home and need a change of scenery.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We Value Diversity: </strong>We seek to build an inclusive workplace that welcomes people from all different backgrounds. A welcoming, international, dedicated team with flat hierarchies and trust by default.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Employee Discounts: </strong>You’ll get to enjoy the Yepoda products at a discount and share it with friends and family to keep your glow going!</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Unique Add Ons:</strong> A monthly benefits budget that's yours to spend. Through the Probonio app you pick what actually fits your lifestyle.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Would you like to be part of the team? Then we'd love to hear from you! 🫰✨</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make sure to apply by clicking on the “Apply for this job” button below. Please upload your CV and Cover Letter in English language. Our Talent Acquisition team will review your application and get back to you as soon as possible.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>At Yepoda we are dedicated to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals, regardless of race, color, ethnicity, ancestry, religion, national origin, citizenship, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, parental status, disability, or any other status protected by applicable law.</em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/yepoda/campaign-manager-berlin-69682","tags":["Marketing"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1795156812},{"slug":"venture-development-munich-169027","company_name":"Tacto","title":"Venture Development","description":"<h1>About Tacto</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Tacto builds Industrial AI for procurement in manufacturing. Built for industrial complexity, designed to optimize every procurement decision.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Over 50% of a product’s cost originates from suppliers, making procurement the single largest cost lever in manufacturing and the missing connection between the digital and the physical world.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">400+ procurement organizations work with Tacto</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">~110 people on the team in Munich</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">€50M+ raised, led by Sequoia and Index Ventures, with Cherry Ventures, UVC Partners and others</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1>Our mission at Tacto</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We make industry stronger.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manufacturing is the backbone of the European economy, and supply chains are its biggest challenge. Yet procurement in many companies still runs on Excel and legacy systems. With AI, we are fundamentally changing how manufacturers buy: measurably lower material costs and far less manual work.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>Your role</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You build the teams that build Tacto, working directly with our CEO and Chief of Staff.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why this role exists</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are entering our next growth phase in the AGI age: new markets, new teams and the structures that carry them. Almost all of it runs through people: who we hire, how we set up teams and the culture of ambition we protect. As a Venture Developer, you own several hiring pipelines across functions, from Sales to Tech to Customer Value, and you help make Tacto the place where the best talent in Europe wants to work. Our own AI agents do much of the searching and first outreach, so about half of your week goes to what only people get to do: speaking to talent, judging fit and giving every candidate a great experience. You work directly with André (CEO) and Marla (Chief of Staff).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why your role matters</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You decide who gets in.</strong> You run the first interviews and shape which candidates our hiring managers meet. Every person you move forward can shape a team at Tacto for years. Talent is our biggest lever in building a generational company.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You see every part of the company.</strong> You interact with Sales, Tech and Customer Value roles and learn fast what great looks like in each.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI does the groundwork, you bring the judgement.</strong> Our agents search, score and write to candidates. You decide where they look, check what they find and raise their bar.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You grow as fast as you deliver.</strong> 70%+ of our leadership team was promoted internally. After your first year, you shape your own path: in Talent, Ops, Tech or in a commercial role.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What your week looks like</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Interviews:</strong> about 40%</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Steering and reviewing sourcing:</strong> about 20%</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Candidate communication and scheduling:</strong> about 10%</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Events, campaigns, merch and employer branding:</strong> about 20%</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Other:</strong> about 10%</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What this role is and isn’t</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Hands on:</strong> The first 9 to 12 months are about execution: many interviews and candidate calls, clean pipelines and events that run smoothly. It's not always glamorous, but some of the highest leverage work at Tacto and that's how we like it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Not a closing role:</strong> Offers and final negotiations sit with our Chief of Staff and the hiring managers. Your job is to bring the right people to the final round, with a clear picture of who they are and making sure that everybody is aligned to provide the best possible candidate experience we can.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Not a strategy role:</strong> Those don’t exist at Tacto. It is also not a short stop: we look for people who want to grow here. Where you want to grow and into which direction you want to take your career is up to you to define. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The deal:</strong> Prove yourself with real impact, and we back your growth in every way we can.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>Your tasks</h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Own your pipelines and build the org:</strong> You own a few open roles at a time, often in very different teams. You agree with each hiring manager on who we are looking for and keep the pipeline moving until the final interview.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Interview and assess:</strong> You run first interviews, judge fit against a clear bar and give hiring managers a sharp recommendation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Orchestrate sourcing:</strong> Our AI skills search, score and write to candidates. You decide where they look, review what they find and source yourself where it counts.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Turn candidates into fans:</strong> You make our process fast, personal and honest, from the first message to the final interview. Even the people we say no to should walk away telling their friends to apply.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build a base that scales:</strong> You set up job descriptions, interview plans, pipelines and data that let us grow the team without losing speed or quality. What you build today is how Tacto hires tomorrow.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><