1.5em">Drive the automation, standardisation and scalability of accounting and reporting processes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Oversee the accounting treatment of financing, receivables, leasing and factoring-related transactions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support accounting topics related to SPVs, securitisation and financing structures where required.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate tax and VAT compliance together with external advisors and internal stakeholders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate internal and external audits and ensure timely resolution of audit findings.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as the key accounting partner for EFS management and stakeholders across the Enpal Group.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Translate complex accounting topics into practical recommendations for business stakeholders.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>What you’ll bring</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A degree in Accounting, Finance, or a comparable field.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Several years of relevant experience in Accounting, Financial Reporting, Group Accounting, Audit, or a comparable finance function.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong knowledge of HGB and IFRS as well as month-end, year-end and statutory reporting processes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with financial reporting, consolidation and closing activities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven experience improving, simplifying and automating accounting processes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A hands-on, pragmatic and solution-oriented working style with a high degree of ownership.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong stakeholder management and communication skills with the ability to explain complex accounting matters in a clear and practical way.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent English; German is a plus.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are you interested even if you don't meet all the requirements? Apply anyway! We look forward to discovering your potential, regardless of whether your experience meets every single requirement. ☀️</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h3><strong>What we offer</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Work at Germany's first green unicorn</strong> - Play an active role in shaping the solar energy transition.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The sun shines all over the world</strong> - At Enpal, you'll work with a highly motivated, diverse team of over 65 nationalities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The ideal setup for your focus</strong> - We are convinced that excellent results are achieved when the conditions are right. That's why we rely on a hybrid working concept that gives you the freedom to always work in the way that best suits your tasks. Do you need new inspiration on an international level? With Workflex, we offer you the opportunity to relocate abroad for up to 30 days a year, depending on your responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Grown-up business &amp; startup spirit</strong> - In our modern office in Berlin-Friedrichshain, you'll find everything your heart desires, from height-adjustable desks and table tennis to stocked beverage fridges and barista coffee.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your kick-start at Enpal</strong> - Onboarding day with a welcome bag, buddy program, and a team that really supports you.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Stay up to date &amp; help shape the future</strong> - Transparent all-hands meetings, short decision-making processes, and an open feedback culture - without mistakes, there is no progress.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The energy transition ca