&lt;div&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://xometry.eu/en/policy/&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/xometryeurope/senior-engineering-manager-munich-133190","tags":["Technology","EU"],"job_types":[],"location":"Munich","created_at":1795146922},{"slug":"remote-founding-tech-lead-growthbricks-155233","company_name":"jetbrains","title":"Founding Tech Lead (GrowthBricks)","description":"&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Founding Tech Lead (GrowthBricks)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a hands-on engineer who loves zero-to-one challenges? Do you want to build systems with real context and memory that do more than reason, use tools, and drive actual business outcomes?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems. Our mission is simple: make development teams more productive and AI adoptable at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GrowthBricks is a new project at JetMinds, backed by JetBrains, designed to give GTM teams and AI agents a shared business brain. Business context usually gets fragmented across CRMs, documents, dashboards, and people&#39;s heads. GrowthBricks brings that context together so agents and people can make decisions and execute effectively across the sales, marketing, and product stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About GrowthBricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GrowthBricks is a shared business brain for GTM teams and AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It brings together the context that usually lives across CRM, docs, dashboards, tools, and people’s heads: who we sell to, why customers buy, what matters now, what we tried, and what worked. Agents and people use that context to decide what to do next and execute across the GTM stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GrowthBricks is a new project at JetMinds, backed by JetBrains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a hands-on Founding Tech Lead to build GrowthBricks from zero.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work directly with the product founder and own the technical side of the product: architecture, core systems, integrations, and the agent layer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The core challenge is turning fragmented, changing business context into reliable memory and agent actions across tools and measuring whether those actions actually drive business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll write a lot of the early code yourself, make the key technical decisions, and shape the product as we learn what works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll work on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the core architecture: business context, agents, tools, integrations, and feedback loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build agentic workflows that can reason over company context and act across CRM, sales, marketing, and product systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build context extractors from GTM team artifacts like sales calls, emails, internal documents, CRM state, marketing campaigns, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on prompting, context management, memory, tool use, and orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect GrowthBricks to the existing GTM stack rather than rebuilding everything around it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decide where to use MCP, APIs, frameworks, or third-party tools and where a custom solution is worth it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype fast, discard weak ideas, and turn the useful ones into product primitives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We expect that you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a strong hands-on engineer who enjoys zero-to-one work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built with LLMs, agents, or agentic workflows used by real people, and improved them based on failures, evaluations, and user feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand how context, prompting, tools, and agent behavior fit together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can design backend systems, APIs, data models, and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable making decisions before all the answers are known.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prefer simple, pragmatic solutions over unnecessary complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re especially interested if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked in solution engineering, sales engineering, pre-sales, or built software for GTM teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the modern GTM stack: CRM, enrichment, outbound, automation, and product signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have automated sales or marketing workflows, ideally with agents or LLMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have owned a technical product from a blank repo to something people actually used.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GTM experience is not mandatory, but if you already understand how sales and marketing teams work, that is a strong advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive salary and strong benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The runway and resources of an established company, with startup-level autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A founding role with direct influence over both product and architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real users and real workflows from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freedom to choose the stack, tools, and technical approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A chance to help define what an agent-native GTM product should look like.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-IM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/jetbrains/remote-founding-tech-lead-growthbricks-155233","tags":["GrowthBricks"],"job_types":[],"location":"Berlin; Remote","created_at":1795146921},{"slug":"software-product-assurance-engineer-411479","company_name":"Constellrgmbh","title":"Software Product Assurance Engineer","description":"&lt;h2 class=&quot;sc-1npqnwg-4 sc-1npqnwg-5 sc-1uwf3m5-0 ghXWGq custom-css-style-job-description&quot;&gt;Job description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Reporting Line:&lt;/strong&gt; Program Management Team | Reports to Lead Project &amp;amp; Procurement Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Paragraph SCXW53634494 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At constellr, we use thermal intelligence from space to understand what is happening on Earth – where, when and at scale. Our satellite constellation delivers high-resolution land surface temperature data, giving governments, defence organisations, commercial operators and global institutions the intelligence they need to monitor change, assess risk and make better-informed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From national security and critical infrastructure to agriculture and climate resilience, constellr turns temperature into actionable intelligence for a changing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a proactive and detail-driven team player&amp;nbsp;to join our&amp;nbsp;Product and Quality Assurance (PQA) team, with a strong focus on&amp;nbsp;Flight Software Product Assurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will play a critical part in ensuring the&amp;nbsp;quality, safety, and reliability of both flight and ground software&amp;nbsp;across our growing satellite constellation. You will work at the intersection of&amp;nbsp;engineering, quality, and operations, helping to shape how we build and deliver software in a&amp;nbsp;fast-moving, mission-critical space environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The PQA team defines and maintains the company’s&amp;nbsp;quality and Product Assurance standards. Your work will directly contribute to ensuring our software meets the&amp;nbsp;highest levels of robustness, compliance, and reliability, supporting mission success in both&amp;nbsp;orbit and ground operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for someone who thrives in&amp;nbsp;complex, technical environments, enjoys working across disciplines, and is comfortable balancing&amp;nbsp;structured quality processes&amp;nbsp;with the pace of a rapidly scaling space organisation. You will be trusted to take&amp;nbsp;end-to-end ownership, bring clarity to ambiguity, and help embed strong&amp;nbsp;engineering discipline across the software lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop, implement, and continuously improve a robust&amp;nbsp;Software Product Assurance (PA) programme, reporting directly to the&amp;nbsp;Product Assurance Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take&amp;nbsp;end-to-end ownership of Software Product Assurance&amp;nbsp;across both&amp;nbsp;flight and ground software&amp;nbsp;for our satellite constellation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure rigorous application of&amp;nbsp;software configuration management and release processes, maintaining strong&amp;nbsp;version control, traceability, and engineering discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enforce compliance with&amp;nbsp;safety-critical and mission-critical software standards, with a strong focus on&amp;nbsp;risk reduction and failure prevention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define and oversee&amp;nbsp;software testing, verification, and validation strategies&amp;nbsp;across all development and delivery phases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Investigate, manage, and resolve&amp;nbsp;software anomalies&amp;nbsp;throughout development, testing, integration, and operational phases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support&amp;nbsp;Spacecraft Assembly, Integration and Testing (AIT)&amp;nbsp;activities, ensuring&amp;nbsp;software readiness and compliance&amp;nbsp;at every stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate and lead&amp;nbsp;software deliveries from suppliers, ensuring alignment with&amp;nbsp;internal standards, schedules, and quality expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participate in&amp;nbsp;subcontractor reviews and key technical meetings, working closely with&amp;nbsp;procurement engineers and Product Assurance stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Balance the demands of&amp;nbsp;rapid development cycles&amp;nbsp;with the need to maintain strong&amp;nbsp;Product Assurance and software quality standards&amp;nbsp;in a fast-paced space environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;sc-1npqnwg-4 sc-1npqnwg-5 sc-1uwf3m5-0 sc-1uwf3m5-1 kIUTHT custom-css-style-job-requirements&quot;&gt;Job requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Degree in&amp;nbsp;Engineering, Computer Science, Physics, or a related scientific discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven experience in&amp;nbsp;Flight Software Product Assurance within the space industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of&amp;nbsp;software testing, verification, and validation&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;safety-critical environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with&amp;nbsp;embedded flight software for satellites, spacecraft platforms, or payload systems&amp;nbsp;(experience with&amp;nbsp;FDIR&amp;nbsp;highly desirable).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong proficiency in&amp;nbsp;software configuration management tools and processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with&amp;nbsp;ECSS standards, particularly&amp;nbsp;ECSS-Q-ST-80C (Software Product Assurance)&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;ECSS-E-ST-40C (Software Engineering).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;analytical thinking and problem-solving skills, with experience in&amp;nbsp;risk management and anomaly investigation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to manage&amp;nbsp;competing priorities and deadlines, with a proactive approach to&amp;nbsp;risk identification and escalation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;team mindset, with a desire to help&amp;nbsp;build and shape a growing organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable working&amp;nbsp;independently, taking ownership and delivering in a&amp;nbsp;fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent&amp;nbsp;written and spoken English communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with&amp;nbsp;automation, scripting, or AI-assisted engineering tools&amp;nbsp;(e.g. prompt-based workflows).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to&amp;nbsp;high-growth or start-up aerospace environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Broader understanding of&amp;nbsp;end-to-end spacecraft systems engineering lifecycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join constellr?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Impact National Security Mission:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Be part of an ambitious mission to launch the world’s first commercial thermal infrared constellation, delivering sovereign-grade &quot;behavioural&quot; intelligence from space to close critical blind spots for defence, intelligence, and maritime surveillance agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fast-Paced &quot;New Space&quot; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work at the leading edge of a rapidly evolving defence sector. By leveraging modern, agile New Space methodologies, you will help design, build, and deploy dual-use thermal payloads into operational orbit at a speed and scale that traditional aerospace models simply cannot match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Broad Interdisciplinary Exposure:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Accelerate your professional growth by collaborating daily with a diverse, international cohort of astrophysicists, software developers, and defence-system engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusive &amp;amp; Scientific Culture:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Join a high-trust team deeply committed to diversity, inclusion, and scientific excellence, where academic curiosity is paired with high autonomy and a flat hierarchy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Upside &amp;amp; Well-being:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Benefit from a Virtual Share Option Plan (VSOP) for permanent employees, giving you a true stake in the company&#39;s growth, alongside highly flexible hybrid working models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/constellrgmbh/software-product-assurance-engineer-411479","tags":["Programme Management"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1795146918},{"slug":"system-engineer-softwareverteilung-client-management-mainz-248235","company_name":"True Talent Solutions Partners","title":"System Engineer Softwareverteilung & Client Management","description":"<h3>About the Role</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join an IT services team supporting public sector and education customers with reliable infrastructure and client management solutions. You will implement and improve software distribution systems, helping customers deliver and manage software across their environments.</p><h3>What You'll Do</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead the deployment and use of software distribution platforms, including baramundi or Matrix42.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Create, test, and adapt software packages for customer environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support the technical coordination of large rollout projects, including remote work and device preparation in a staging area.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Implement solutions in customer environments, advise on process improvements, and lead workshops.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Troubleshoot software distribution infrastructure and provide third-level support.</p></li></ul><h3>What We're Looking For</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">At least 3 years of experience in IT system administration or support, including building or delivering software distribution solutions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep project experience with baramundi or Matrix42; knowledge of Microsoft MECM/SCCM or Intune is beneficial.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong knowledge of Windows 10/11 and experience with Windows Server environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience creating software packages and implementing software distribution solutions in customer environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confident PowerShell skills for routine task automation and a basic understanding of DHCP, DNS, and PXE.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Completed vocational training in IT systems integration or a comparable IT degree.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">German language skills at C1 level. Relevant vendor certifications are an advantage.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Structured, accountable working style and strong customer communication skills.</p></li></ul><h3>Compensation &amp; Benefits</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Salary: €50,000 to €70,000 annually. Visa sponsorship is not available.</p><h3>Location</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hybrid in Mainz, Germany.</p><hr><p>Compensation: €50K – €70K</p><ul><li> • €50K – €70K</li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/true-talent-solutions-partners/system-engineer-softwareverteilung-client-management-mainz-248235","tags":["Client Roles"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Mainz","created_at":1795146187},{"slug":"senior-partner-berlin-294583","company_name":"True Talent Solutions Partners","title":"Senior Partner","description":"<h3>About the Role</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join an AI-native legal services firm as a senior, market-facing partner. You will bring an established client practice to an AI-enabled platform and help grow the firm's commercial and compliance services.</p><h3>What You'll Do</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Shape the firm's growth strategy and contribute to its development toward the next funding stage.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Continue serving your existing clients through the firm's technology platform.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build market awareness and generate opportunities through your professional network.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify and develop cross-selling opportunities for commercial and compliance services.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with the founding team to transition recurring legal matters to AI-supported workflows.</p></li></ul><h3>What We're Looking For</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">12 to 20 or more years of German legal practice, with experience at partner level in a recognized law firm or equivalent boutique.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">German-qualified Volljurist, admitted as a Rechtsanwalt, with native-level German and professional English.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A personally held, portable book of business worth at least €1 million, with a diversified client base and a path to client transition.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience serving private equity, venture capital, or mid-market clients, including networks that can support commercial and compliance work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A practice with recurring, potentially automatable matters such as commercial contracts, IT and data, corporate or venture capital, or regulatory work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on use of AI tools such as Claude, ChatGPT, or legal AI products, and a genuine interest in applying automation to legal work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Authorized to work in Germany without visa sponsorship.</p></li></ul><h3>Compensation &amp; Benefits</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Base salary: €200,000 to €300,000 annually. The role includes meaningful equity. Visa sponsorship is not available.</p><h3>Location</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Based in Berlin, Germany. The role can be on-site or remote within Germany; in-person work in Berlin is preferred, with remote considered for exceptional candidates.</p><hr><p>Compensation: €200K – €300K</p><ul><li> • €200K – €300K</li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/true-talent-solutions-partners/senior-partner-berlin-294583","tags":["Client Roles"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1795146187},{"slug":"senior-system-administrator-freiburg-im-breisgau-343319","company_name":"True Talent Solutions Partners","title":"Senior System Administrator","description":"<h3>About the Role</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join a small back-office IT team at a SaaS company, helping maintain secure and reliable infrastructure across a heterogeneous Windows and Linux environment. You will support core systems and contribute to infrastructure and compliance projects.</p><h3>What You'll Do</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Administer and maintain servers, networks, and storage across Windows and Linux systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure the availability of core infrastructure, including Proxmox, Kubernetes, CEPH, and networking.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Install, configure, and support hardware and software.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Monitor system performance and maintain the availability and security of IT infrastructure.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Investigate and resolve technical issues and service disruptions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Plan and deliver IT projects, including work related to ISO 27001 and C5 compliance requirements.</p></li></ul><h3>What We're Looking For</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">At least 3 years of experience in system administration or a comparable role managing servers, networks, and storage.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Completed vocational training, a degree in computer science, or a comparable qualification.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Production experience with virtualization, particularly Proxmox, and administration of both Windows and Linux systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong knowledge of server administration, networking, and IT security.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with Microsoft 365 and cloud services such as Azure in hybrid environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">German proficiency at C1 level and English proficiency at B2 level.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with Kubernetes, CEPH, procurement, supplier management, or ISO 27001/C5 compliance is beneficial.</p></li></ul><h3>Compensation &amp; Benefits</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">An indefinite-term employment contract with compensation based on qualifications and experience. Visa sponsorship is not available.</p><h3>Location</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">On-site in Freiburg im Breisgau, Germany.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/true-talent-solutions-partners/senior-system-administrator-freiburg-im-breisgau-343319","tags":["Client Roles"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Freiburg im Breisgau","created_at":1795146187},{"slug":"business-solution-engineer-c-net-dusseldorf-23252","company_name":"True Talent Solutions Partners","title":"Business Solution Engineer, C#/.NET","description":"<h3>About the Role</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join a financial services team as a Business Solution Engineer, translating complex business needs into well-designed software solutions. You will work directly with business units, using modern AI tools to deliver and refine solutions with strong technical quality.</p><h3>What You'll Do</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Gather and analyze complex requirements through direct