eated_at":1795146187},{"slug":"information-security-officer-isb-cologne-28318","company_name":"True Talent Solutions Partners","title":"Information Security Officer (ISB)","description":"<h3>About the Role</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">As an Information Security Officer, you will advise clients on the strategic and operational development of their information security programs. You will work with management and specialist teams to address regulatory requirements and build sustainable governance structures across a range of industries.</p><h3>What You'll Do</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Serve as an external Information Security Officer for clients, supporting the ongoing development of their information security programs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Advise business teams and senior leaders on requirements including NIS2, DORA, CRA, ISO 27001, and IEC 62443.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Conduct risk analyses, gap analyses, and maturity assessments, then develop practical recommendations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support the setup, development, and operation of information security management systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Plan and facilitate workshops, status meetings, steering committees, cyber incident simulations, and tabletop exercises.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help clients establish and improve governance, risk, and compliance processes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop reusable approaches, templates, documentation, and tools for client projects.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute expertise to new services and proposals, and support technical presentations, webinars, and written content.</p></li></ul><h3>What We're Looking For</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">At least 3 years of professional experience in information security, GRC, ISMS, or cybersecurity consulting.</p></li><li><p style="min-hei