ing processes - your job is to make them better. You will build the people workflows, automation, documentation and self-service mechanisms that allow Photoroom to keep moving quickly as we grow, without creating unnecessary complexity.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This scope has so far sat within a small generalist People team. You will be the first person to own it as a dedicated senior scope, giving you the opportunity to shape this operating model.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are also an AI-native company, and we want our People function to operate the same way. We expect you to actively use automation and AI to improve speed, reliability and employee experience, while maintaining a high bar for privacy, compliance and trust.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will report to our VP People. This is a senior individual contributor role with no direct reports today.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2>Why this role exists</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We have built a lot quickly. Today, our People Operations environment includes:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">French and USA payroll and entity obligations</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">European employees through an EOR setup</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Growing Paris and New York offices</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Multiple benefits providers and external partners</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An HR technology stack that has grown alongside the company</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">The foundations work. Now they need a clear owner and regular improvements.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We want to move from processes that depend on individual knowledge and manual intervention to an operating model that is <strong>documented, automated, measurable and more self-service for our employees</strong>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your goal is to strengthen our foundations with proven 