oyees and managers can actually find, understand and use</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h3>Employee lifecycle</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Onboarding administration from signed offer through day one, coordinating payroll, benefits, declarations, IT access, equipment, manager actions ect..</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Offboarding and exit administration, including documentation, payroll, benefits, access removal and final employment documents</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Promotions, compensation changes, employment changes, contract amendments, leaves, parental leave and other employee changes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Immigration and visa administration, including external providers, applications, renewals and deadline tracking</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h3>Benefits &amp; Compensation</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Administer benefits and manage providers across France, Europe and the US</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run annual renewals with Finance and the VP People, using cost, usage and employee value to inform decisions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support compensation benchmarking and salary band maintenance</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h3>HRIS, data and automation</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our HRIS is Hibob today, which may or may not change. You will own the reliability and evolution of our People systems.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This includes:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">HRIS configuration, permissions, workflows, integrations and data quality</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Making the HRIS the reliable source of truth for employee data</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assessing opportunities to consolidate or improve our HR technology stack</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Automating repetitive workflows wherever doing so improves speed and reliability</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h3>Employee support</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will help us move from a People team that repeatedly answers standard questions to one that builds systems people can use themselves.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will build the documentation, workflows, processes and self-service infrastructure that make the majority of standard People requests easy to solve without intervention, while personally handling the exceptions and escalations that genuinely require expertise.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2>What we are looking for</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have already owned a meaningful People Operations scope in a fast-moving company of +100 employees.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">In particular, we are looking for:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience with French payroll and employment compliance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience owning People Operations processes, workflows, and controls </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">HRIS experience. Hibob is a plus, but experience configuring and improving a comparable system matters more</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A systems mindset and a strong instinct for automation</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent operational judgement. You know which issues you can solve yourself and which require specialist advice</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">High standards of accuracy, discretion and follow-through</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort operating independently in a small team where you will both design the process and run it</p></li><li><p style="min-h