t relationships</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop scalable tools, frameworks and knowledge resources that empower further our sales teams </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h2>⭐️<strong> Is it you we’re looking for? </strong>⭐️ </h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You would thrive in this role if you: </p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are able to navigate and synthesize technical, data, legal and business considerations related to health and income protection insurance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">2 years of experience in Health and/or "Prevoyance" Insurance are a big plus but are not required</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are analytical and structured, with a fact-based decision-making style</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are excited about bringing technical expertise in a business-centric context</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are willing to deeply change the insurance industry and challenge the status quo</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Approach challenges with a scalability perspective, continuously identifying opportunities to optimize processes and systems</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have strong written communication skills, with the ability to simplify complex concepts</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are fluent in both French (French clients) and English (Alan’s working language)</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">For this role we are looking to hire within the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/en/careers/a/salary-equity">C1-F level range</a>. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>🌍 How we work</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Location:</strong> You must be legally eligible to work from France.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Remote work:</strong> We offer remote work flexibility, but we 