em">Prevention as the new norm. That's what we're building with our team of 1000+ people. If it speaks to you: we're hiring across France, Spain, Belgium, and Canada. And beyond.</p><h1><strong>Mission</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Alan is scaling internationally (800+ employees, 100+ healthcare professionals, 5+ countries) and needs IT Engineers to build and own the internal technology platform every Alaner works on: identity and provisioning, endpoint and SaaS security, the tooling behind our clinics, and the automation that keeps IT from scaling linearly with headcount.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The scope below is what the team owns, not a checklist for one person. You'll be staffed on one or two of these areas at a time, according to your strengths and interests, and it will evolve through time based on company needs and personal appetite.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Staying close to users keeps us building the right things: you'll spend up to 2-3 days a month on IT support, seeing first-hand where friction lives and what's worth automating next.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Scope</strong></h1><h3><strong>⚙️ Platform &amp; automation</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own and extend automations on Alan Home, our internal provisioning engine</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain, extend and improve helpdesk automation, SaaS provisioning flows, and onboarding/offboarding pipelines</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the meeting room AV and room-booking platform as a product, replicable across offices</p></li></ul><h3><strong>🔑 Identity &amp; access</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the IT side of the employee lifecycle (onboarding, offboarding, mobility between jobs and countries) across Google Workspace, SSO/SAML and our SaaS ecosystem.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Grow our role-based access model: extend it to more tools and refine the permission groups, so access is granted by role rather than case by case</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make employee lifecycle events reliable, fast and auditable end-to-end</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own access reviews and least-privilege models; produce and maintain the evidence our auditors rely on</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own SaaS procurement and license management: vendor relationships, renewals, and cost optimization across our stack</p></li></ul><h3><strong>🔒 Endpoint &amp; SaaS security</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the Mac fleet in Kandji: enrollment at scale, role-based blueprints, fleet compliance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Cloudflare WARP, SaaS security controls</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain and strengthen our ISO 27001 certification and drive ACPR and pentest remediation on the endpoint and platform scope</p></li></ul><h3><strong>🩺 Health Professionals IT</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The IT layer behind Alan's clinics: practitioner tooling, equipment, access</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Role and permission automation for healthcare professionals, and their support and escalation process</p></li></ul><h3><strong>🌍 Internationalisation</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make international expansion something IT accelerates, not something it slows down: a repeatable process where every new market (Canada, KSA, Armenia...) launches on our standard stack from day one</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring acquired entities onto that same platform</p></li></ul><h1><strong>Milestones</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>First 3 months</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Acquire technical knowledge on Alan's platform: Alan Home, Google Workspace/SSO, Kandji, Cloudflare WARP</