r other teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Product and offer launches:</strong> Support the launch of new product features (e.g. Mo, Alan Précision) and new offers (e.g. Alan retirees) in France. Work in strong collaboration with the Product teams to build a creative, impactful go-to-market that stands out in the market. Turn product positioning into launch plans and assets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Partnerships and events: </strong>Run vertical-specific events, sponsorships, ambassador and creator partnerships that build credibility with each audience.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Local markets:</strong> Give feedback on local briefs and plans. Spot French initiatives that could scale to other markets and capture them in playbooks.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Measurement:</strong> Set KPIs for every project (reach in the target, qualified leads, pipeline influenced, brand perception). Run test-and-learn with Growth and Data. Manage budgets, vendors and deadlines.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>You're a good fit if you</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have<strong> 7+ years </strong>of <strong>in-house brand marketing</strong> (B2C, B2B or B2B2C). Paid media or media planning is a big plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have<strong> led at least two B2B campaigns</strong> or <strong>brand projects end to end</strong>, and can walk us through the problem, your choices and the measurable result.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have <strong>managed agencies and budgets</strong> and made trade-offs when resources were tight.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are a<strong> generalist </strong>across campaigns, content, partnerships, events and PR, with sharp creative judgment you can defend with senior stakeholders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set<strong> brand KPIs</strong> and link brand 