<li>Several years of experience in commercial, technology, SaaS, or in-house legal roles.</li>
<li>Demonstrated ability to independently manage and negotiate complex B2B and enterprise customer agreements.</li>
<li>Experience supporting sales teams and advising business stakeholders in a fast-paced, international environment.</li>
<li>Strong understanding of SaaS contracts, technology transactions, data protection, intellectual property, and commercial risk.</li>
<li>Pragmatic, commercially minded, highly organized, and comfortable working autonomously while collaborating across functions and geographies.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Required Skills – Hard Skills</strong></p>
