<li>Strong experience drafting, reviewing, and negotiating B2B commercial agreements, particularly SaaS and technology contracts.</li>
<li>Solid knowledge of key contractual provisions, including liability, indemnification, warranties, intellectual property, confidentiality, data protection, service levels, and termination.</li>
