atic, search, social, video) that deliver effective and accountable outcomes for our clients including budget and flighting recommendations, audience targeting recommendations, performance forecasts and channel tactics</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">In partnership with your client leads, you will maintain a working relationship with paid media client partners</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead the collaboration with Jellyfish specialists from market intelligence, investment analytics, and paid media teams to create unique ideas and experiment with new methods and technologies to solve complex issues.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use attribution, media mix modelling and planning tools (GWI, YouGov, Reach Planner, ComScore) to pull audience use, reports and forecast target goals</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with the wider planning and analytics team to create insightful campaign reports with optimisation recommendations while media is live</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with teams (Paid Search, Display, Analytics) to ensure planning follows platform and buying best practices</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with channel and measurement leads on campaign performance reporting to drive results through testing and ongoing optimisation</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain professional relationships with the publisher and partner community</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proactively monitor the digital landscape and identify trends/partners for upcoming campaigns.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Qualifications</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in a media strategy or planning role, or in a cross-channel buying role within an agency or multinational client organization</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated expertise in developing brand, digital marketing and plannin